everything to +4/+5 -- before then, the cornuthaum has one _less_ point of 
AC.   By the time all my armor is maxed out, 25% more power regen does a lot 
more for me than one extra point of AC.

> But then I'm biased.
 
I think you are.  Cornuthaum might be preferable from a roleplaying 
perspective, but the helm of brilliance is better mechanically, just as SDSM 
is better than mithril.

